[[576,8,4096,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The supply for the fan \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               arrives\ndirectly from the battery from the line for the maxifuse  FAN 1\nof \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : the fan therefore works when it receives an earth command.</p><p>The specific relays \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J31</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               for\nthe cooling system have coils supplied by the line controlled by\nthe ignition (15/54) protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional\nfuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>They are energized by an earth signal coming\nfrom the engine control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>If the engine coolant reaches a first temperature\nlevel, the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends (from pin 23 of connector\nB) an earth signal to the fan 1st speed relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which energizes\nthe coil. The relay then sends an earth signal which, via the additional\nresistor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>O10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , operates the fan \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which rotates at\nthe first (slow) speed.</p><p>If the engine coolant reaches a higher temperature,\nthe control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends (from 45 of connector C) an earth\nsignal to the fan 2nd speed relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J31</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which energizes the\ncoil. The relay then sends an earth signal directly to the fan \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which\nrotates at the maximum speed.</p>"]]